     <h1 class="style48">Welcome User!!!</h1>
      <p> In the Citizen-Centric Scheme Mapping System, the user plays the key role of accessing and utilizing government welfare schemes based on their personal eligibility. After registering and creating a profile with details like age, gender, caste, income, and education, the user is shown a list of schemes filtered specifically to match their criteria. The system allows users to view detailed information about each scheme and apply for suitable ones directly through the platform. Users can also manage their applications, update personal information, and receive notifications about new or updated schemes. The entire process is designed to make it easier for citizens to discover, understand, and benefit from government schemes with minimal effort.
